# Scratch: server stdout/stderr redirects and one-off engine output. `*.log`
# already covered the logs, but not the `.err` redirects or a reconstruction
# written here to be looked at once — which is how this directory started
# showing up as untracked with a GLB in it.
.runtime-logs/

# Local coordination and research inputs. These are deliberately outside the
# product artefact: the ledger contains machine/session history; the two loose
# IFCs do not yet carry exact source and redistribution attribution in this
# repository; and sample-bim is a nested third-party checkout. Keep the inputs
# locally for provenance review without silently shipping them.
